# Everything the image does not need. Two reasons this file matters more than
# image size: a smaller context makes the build cache far less likely to miss,
# and `.env` sitting in the build context is one `COPY . .` away from a secret
# baked into a published layer.

.git
.github
.gitignore

# Secrets and local configuration. Never in a build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local state
.workspace
.workspace-*
.venv
venv
*.egg-info
dist
build

# Caches
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# Not needed at runtime. Tests are run in CI against the source tree, not
# inside the image — an image that ships its own tests invites someone to
# trust a suite that ran against different dependencies than production.
tests
docs
*.md
!README.md
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
k8s
